Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.27,0:06:47.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其实不会很怪吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's not that weird, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.99,0:06:49.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怪得不得了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's very weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.65,0:06:54.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我才不要听某人告诉我  我扩张了"一滴滴"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't want some guy down there telling me I'm "dilated-a-mundo."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.70,0:06:59.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老实说  他不是在模仿方奇\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}To be fair, He doesn't seem to be impersonating Fonzie...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.83,0:07:01.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在干什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.38,0:07:05.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,干嘛替他辩解  去帮我另外找一个\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why are you defending him? Just get me another doctor...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.28,0:07:07.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有发疯  不是方奇的医生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...One who is not crazy and who is not Fonzie!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.59,0:07:10.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其实他不是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Again, it's not that he…Aah! Aah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.31,0:07:18.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在这里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh-hey-hey-hey! there you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.02,0:07:21.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有件事应该让你知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Um, listen there's something I think you should know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.73,0:07:24.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是你要跟护士约会的事吗  我听乔伊说了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Is this about you dating the nurse? Joey told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.98,0:07:28.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我一点也不在意  你和我又没什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and I am so-so fine. I mean, you and I we're just, y'know, we're nothing
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.78,0:07:31.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们只是玩玩\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Just goofing around.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.03,0:07:38.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其实我是想告诉你  我打算推掉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Umm, actually I was about to tell you that I was, I was going to get out of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.24,0:07:42.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,既然我们只是玩玩  那我就跟他出去好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}but hey, if we're just goofing around then uh, maybe I will go out with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.29,0:07:44.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  那我也要\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Fine. Maybe I will too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.79,0:07:49.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喂  你们看我去礼品部\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, you guys! Look what I found in the gift shop...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.63,0:07:52.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,起来  快起来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh. Get up! Get up! Get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.06,0:07:59.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, Pheebs?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.47,0:08:01.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是欧伯曼医生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This is Dr. Oberman.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.56,0:08:04.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他对方奇或《欢乐时光》 的所有人物...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He has no strong feelings about Fonzie...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.44,0:08:07.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都没什么感觉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...or any of the Happy Days gang.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.61,0:08:10.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要升几年级\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi! you're going into what grade?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.82,0:08:15.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我刚升住院医师  常有人那样问我  我提前...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm actually a first-year resident. but I get that a lot, you see, I-I graduated early…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.57,0:08:16.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh-huh. Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.95,0:08:21.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  或许我应该强调  我是要已成年的医师\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross, maybe I should've specified that I'd be needing a grown up doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.37,0:08:24.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我绝对有能力\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Really, I'm fully qualified...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.25,0:08:25.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Shh, Doogie. Shh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.88,0:08:32.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,到底有没有人了解我快生了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Doesn't anybody understand that I'm going to be having babies soon? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.84,0:08:34.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你走  走啊  小毛头\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Go! Go little boy, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.68,0:08:41.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你真行  你把他弄哭了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, cool. You made him cry!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.98,0:08:50.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,崔比亚尼先生  你有肾结石\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Mr. Tribbiani, I'm afraid you've got kidney stones.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.78,0:08:52.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有别的可能吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, well, what else could it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.15,0:08:55.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是肾结石\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's kidney stones.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.07,0:08:57.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或是...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Or...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.32,0:08:58.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,肾结石\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Kidney stones.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.45,0:09:04.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,差不多了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, You're getting there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.00,0:09:07.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这些宝宝很幸运\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, and y'know, These babies are very, very lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.42,0:09:08.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗  为什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They are? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.75,0:09:11.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们的生日日期是方子的一半\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They have the honor of being born on The Fonz's half-birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.34,0:09:15.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,生日快乐\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Happy birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.51,0:09:18.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我澄清一下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Just to clarify.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.68,0:09:20.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是方奇\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm not Fonzie.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.11,0:09:33.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说真的  你能替你弟生孩子真的很棒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Honey, y'know I just gotta tell you,I think this is such a terrific thing you're having these babies for Frank and Alice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.69,0:09:35.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,的确  对啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know, it is. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.20,0:09:38.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以告诉你个秘密吗  你说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Can I tell you a little secret? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.12,0:09:40.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要自己留一个\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I want to keep one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.87,0:09:47.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天哪   我会上新闻\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, I'm going to be on the news.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.59,0:09:53.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  别开玩笑了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, Phoebe, honey, you gotta be kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.69,0:09:55.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你明知你不能这么做\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know you can't keep one of these babies.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.92,0:09:57.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么  搞不好可以  你怎么知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why not? Maybe I can. You don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.13,0:10:02.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我当然知道  法兰克他们一定三个都要\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes! Yes! Yes, I do! I do know! Frank and Alice will want to keep all their children.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.39,0:10:04.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不一定  你确定\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Maybe not. You know?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.27,0:10:07.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说实话  三个宝宝很费事的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Seriously, three babies are a handful.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.56,0:10:10.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也许他们正在找机会送走一个\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}maybe they're y'know, looking for a chance to unload one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.56,0:10:15.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不想因为没开口而失去机会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Listen, I-I hate to miss an opportunity because I didn't ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.78,0:10:19.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  这件事太扯了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe, no. This is insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.16,0:10:21.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你就问问看嘛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Just ask him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.49,0:10:23.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  我去问\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.37,0:10:24.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不能自己问\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't ask him!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.62,0:10:27.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道那样多不成体统吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Do you have any idea how inappropriate that would be?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.29,0:10:31.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,总之你去找法兰克谈  好嘛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All I'm saying is, just talk to Frank. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.00,0:10:33.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,探探他的口风\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Just, y'know, feel him out!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.34,0:10:37.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不行  我怎么能叫法兰克  送你一个孩子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No! Forget it! I am not gonna ask Frank to give you one of his kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.05,0:10:40.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说得对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.93,0:10:47.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就说是你要的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Tell him it's for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.27,0:10:51.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好一点了吗  亲爱的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Feeling better, sweetie?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.06,0:10:53.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一点点吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Maybe a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.02,0:10:55.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真希望你没看到我吐\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wish you hadn't seen me throw up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.32,0:10:58.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也希望\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.70,0:11:03.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我刚刚听说  怎么回事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. I just heard. What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.41,0:11:05.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,肾结石\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Kidney stones.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.50,0:11:12.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,通常我们会用冲击波震碎结石\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ordinarily, Mr. Tribbiani, we try to break the stones up with shock waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.75,0:11:15.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你的结石已经太靠近膀胱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But they're too close to the bladder now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.34,0:11:19.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们要不要等你排尿排出来  或是从尿道往上伸进去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Which means we can either we wait for you to pass them or else go up the urethra...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.59,0:11:25.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  不行  不能往上伸\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, no, no. Nothing is going "up," okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.01,0:11:30.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,绝对不考虑往上   尿道是什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"Up" is not an option. What's a urethra?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.73,0:11:34.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你疯了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.44,0:11:40.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你问他了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So did you ask him?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.28,0:11:42.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还没有机会跟他独处\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, I haven't had a chance to be alone with him yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.36,0:11:44.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的时间有限\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm kind of on a clock here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.99,0:11:48.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,方奇\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, Fonzie.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.08,0:11:54.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我一直都很喜欢魔克\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know who I always liked? Mork.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.05,0:11:59.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,收回  收回\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Undo it. Undo it. Undo it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.09,0:12:03.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,方奇过见魔克\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Fonzie met Mork.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.84,0:12:05.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,魔克把方奇结冻\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Mork froze Fonzie.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.76,0:12:08.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.64,0:12:10.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.09,0:12:14.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是方奇本来就很酷"冷"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...but Fonzie was already cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.86,0:12:18.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以他不会有事  对吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So he wasn't hurt. Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.32,0:12:20.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.78,0:12:25.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.45,0:12:27.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很好  医生说随时都会生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. Doctor says any minute now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.08,0:12:31.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,爱丽丝马上就会到\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, Alice is going to be here so soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.87,0:12:36.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你能不能帮个忙  先hold住他们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You couldn't just do me a favor and, like, hold them in?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.46,0:12:42.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  我正在处理你请我帮的最后一个忙\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sorry Frank, I'm kinda in the middle of the last favor you asked me to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.63,0:12:45.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  瑞秋  嗨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Rachel. Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.05,0:12:49.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡  他是丹  我们星期六的男伴之一\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Monica. This is Dan, one of the guys we're going out with on Saturday.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.01,0:12:51.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,丹  这是摩妮卡\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Dan, Monica.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.52,0:12:52.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很高兴认识你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.27,0:12:55.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好  丹\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hello, Dan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.85,0:13:00.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很期待星期六的约会  非常  非常期持\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm really looking forward to Saturday night. Really! Really!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.99,0:13:05.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,丹\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So Dan...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.49,0:13:07.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是护士不是医生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Nurse, not a doctor, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.20,0:13:09.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有点娘娘腔  对吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Kind of girlie, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.54,0:13:14.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德  没关系\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Chandler. That's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.33,0:13:17.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这只是为了挣钱  好上完医学院\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm just doing this to put myself through medical school.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.25,0:13:22.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且海湾战争时  感觉没那么娘娘腔\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And it didn't feel "girlie" during the Gulf War.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.34,0:13:24.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那当然\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.51,0:13:31.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,感谢你保家卫国\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thanks for doing that for us, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.73,0:13:36.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,何必等到星期六  你明天有空吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So, Why wait till Saturday? Are you free tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.19,0:13:39.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,行啊  我找人代班\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sure. I'll get somebody to cover my shift.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.27,0:13:40.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Aw, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.07,0:13:43.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们星期六  你我  去约个会如何\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, how 'bout it? You, me, Saturday night?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.23,0:13:45.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要  很好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No. All right, very good!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.41,0:13:50.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这一回很痛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This is a big one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.99,0:13:55.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把它弄出来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Unh! Get these things out of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.50,0:13:59.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,深呼吸   深呼吸可以止痛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Breathe! Breathe through the pain.
